{"id":"a3a661ee56e37de5","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-reflection-hierarchy.md","title":"Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","display":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-reflection-hierarchy","aliases":["89-prop-reflection-hierarchy"],"display":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","depends_on":["[[89-df-reflection-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-reflection-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-reflection-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d2469f2990d6f49\" href=\"?note=0d2469f2990d6f49\" title=\"89-df-reflection-formula\">89-df-reflection-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\">\\(\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\\)</span> are the nested\nsyntactic sentence classes used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d2469f2990d6f49\" href=\"?note=0d2469f2990d6f49\" title=\"89-df-reflection-formula\">89-df-reflection-formula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\\)</span> is the corresponding restricted\nreflection schema.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>包含方向来自\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\">\\(\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\\)</span>；理论参数不能从句法类\n的签名中省略。</li>\n<li>这里断言的是反射模式集合的嵌套，不额外声称无条件严格性或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}\\)</span> 与一致性的等价</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-reflection-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ and\n$\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)$ are the nested\nsyntactic sentence classes used by [[89-df-reflection-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}","display":false}],"bytes":1154,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-558","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-reflection-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["0d2469f2990d6f49"]}